sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Aborting observation cannot undo a confirmed effect
  accDescr: An operation succeeds for attempt R, its confirmation is lost, and the caller aborts afterward. The prior effect remains while the caller lacks confirmation.
  participant C as Caller
  participant O as Operation
  C->>O: Start logical attempt R
  Note over O: Effect succeeds
  O--xC: Confirmation lost
  Note over C: abort() requests stop
  Note over O: Prior effect remains
  Note over C: Outcome uncertain
